#: src/Spec.php:168
msgid ""
"Describe at least the columns and the rafters (profile, number, length)."
msgstr "صِف على الأقل الأعمدة وعوارض السقف (المقطع، العدد، الطول)."

#: src/Spec.php:177
msgid "This weight is outside the accepted range."
msgstr "هذا الوزن خارج النطاق المقبول."

#: src/Spec.php:179
msgid ""
"The total weight cannot be lower than the weight of the elements you "
